#   feat     - New feature or functionality
#   fix      - Bug fix or error resolution
#   refactor - Code restructuring, optimization, or style changes
#   chore    - Docs, config, dependencies, tests, or maintenance
#   wip      - Work in progress (temporary checkpoint)
